File: contrib/dbs/tiff-palette.c
Line: 257
Function: main
Bug type: null-pointer-dereference
CWE: CWE-476
Explanation: scan_line is allocated at line 246 without checking for NULL. If malloc fails, it is dereferenced at line 257 (and similarly in other bit-depth cases), causing a NULL pointer dereference.

